  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large paella pan or skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Sauté the chopped onion and bell pepper until tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the smoked paprika and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the ground clove and cook, breaking it up with a spoon, until it is no longer pink, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chicken broth, rice, chorizo, and salt, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, until the rice is cooked and the liquid has been absorbed, about 25 minutes.",
    "Fluff the paella with a fork and garnish with parsley."
